## 🗄️ โครงสร้างฐานข้อมูล PostgreSQL (ที่มีอยู่แล้ว)

```
users           → id, email, password_hash, role (ADMIN/DOCTOR/NURSE)
staff           → id, user_id, first_name, last_name, department_id, specialization, phone
departments     → id, name, description
patients        → id, first_name, last_name, gender, birth_date, phone, address
appointments    → id, patient_id, doctor_id, department_id, start_time, reason, status (PENDING/CHECKED_IN/COMPLETED/CANCELLED)
medical_records → id, appointment_id, diagnosis, treatment, notes
prescriptions   → id, appointment_id
prescription_items → id, prescription_id, medicine_name, dosage, frequency, duration_days
billing         → id, appointment_id, total_amount, status (UNPAID/PAID)
```

**Test Accounts:**
| Email | Password | Role |
|-------|----------|------|
| `admin@hospital.com` | (ต้องใช้ password ดั้งเดิม) | ADMIN |
| `doctor@hospital.com` | (ต้องใช้ password ดั้งเดิม) | DOCTOR |
| `nurse@hospital.com` | (ต้องใช้ password ดั้งเดิม) | NURSE |

